1	/**
2	 * Upgrade Journal, Backups & Crash Recovery Engine (REQ-REL-116, ACC-UPG-09, ACC-UPG-11)
3	 *
4	 * Maintains a persistent transaction journal outside the version directory being replaced:
5	 * - Records stages: idle -> preparing -> downloading -> staged -> switching -> switched -> verified -> complete
6	 * - Automatic and explicit idempotent crash recovery (restoring previous symlink or completing verified transition)
7	 * - Safe pre-migration configuration and state backups with 0600 file / 0700 dir permissions
8	 * - Clean credential preservation without exposing secrets in journal files
9	 */
